# Verbatim ROM extract, kept locally as a scratch source for hand-editing.
# Reproducible from any Red ROM via the engine's own extractor, so there is
# nothing here worth versioning -- and it is the one folder that is a
# straight copy of Nintendo's art rather than a derivative work.
art/trainers_raw/
art/pokemon_raw/*.png

# Stray duplicate of art/trainers_new/ that showed up locally -- not part
# of the pipeline, not versioned.
art/trainer fixed/

# OS junk
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
